<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Paladin Weapons</h1>
<p>The weapon skills the Paladins' guild teaches, in its hall by the Midgaard Cathedral. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the weapon there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each weapon has its own help: help and the weapon's name.
</p>
<pre>Name           Level   Up to
Dagger             0   80%
Fist               0   70%
Quarterstaff       0   50%
Hand Axe           1   80%
Short Sword        2   80%
Mace               3   100%
Rapier             4   100%
Club               5   100%
Broad Sword        8   100%
Falchion           8   60%
Whip               9   100%
Spear             10   80%
War Hammer        10   100%
Adze Mattock      14   80%
Flail             15   90%
Battle Club       16   60%
Long Sword        16   100%
Scimitar          16   60%
Battle Mace       18   100%
Morning Star      20   100%
Lance             21   100%
Maul              24   60%
Claymore          25   100%
Great Sword       25   100%
War Mattock       25   80%
Bardiche          26   70%
Halberd           28   70%
</pre>
